    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>29</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now rewriting the above expression we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>29</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></munder><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><munder><munder><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>27</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></munder></math></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>29</mn><mn>2</mn><